 "summaries": [
  {
   "section": "Tire",
   "text": "All four tires have an adequate amount of remaining tread depth with an even wear pattern."
  },
  {
   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "The windshield washer does not work. There are minor misc scratches around the vehicle. Normal for mileage and most too small to see in photos. There are light scratches on the left quarter panel. There is a dent on the left quarter panel. Refer to picture 24. The vehicle is painted. The right rear bumper and right quarter panel have a paint mismatch. The fog lights and headlights are worn and foggy due to oxidation. The seal on the windshield has some wear. Refer to picture 20. The windshield has a crack. Refer to picture 23. The exterior lights were functional and working properly. The top did not close properly, and there was a message on the dash that the top was not in the limit position. More diagnosis is needed."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is light wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. There is paint wear and chipping on the rear inner panel. Refer to picture 58. The interior trim shows normal wear consistent with age and mileage. The trim on the right side of the dash is missing. Refer to picture 53. The headliner on the rear right is torn and loose. Refer to picture 52. The A/C is not blowing as cold as it should. More diagnosis is needed. I also noted some compressor noises. The sun visors have a broken cover, and the vanity lamp is not working. Refer to pictures 50 and 51. I did not notice any odd smells or signs that the car had been smoked in. There were also no signs of water leaks."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "The engine oil fill and cap have some sludge and varnish. Refer to picture 75. The brake fluid looks old and dirty and should be flushed. Brake fluid has excessive water content. All other accessible fluids are on level. It did not have any visible active fluid leaks at the time of inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Road Test",
   "text": "The vehicle starts up with no issues or unusual sounds. The steering alignment is straight, and engine performance is good. The vehicle shifts through all gears with no issues. The brakes are firm with no pulsations or grinding. I scanned the vehicle's system, and no error codes were found."
  }
 ],
